WEBVTT

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:00.666
She could see their progress quickly,

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:05.152
and it rebuilt her confidence
that she could help her own students.

00:12:05.176 --> 00:12:06.326
Let's be clear --

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:09.436
I'm not suggesting anyone
should work a hundred hours a week,

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.246
let alone add more work on top of it.

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:14.316
The point is that when you're burned out,

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:16.276
it helps to find some small wins.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:17.760
(Music)

00:12:17.784 --> 00:12:19.880
These days, Conrey
is looking for those wins

00:12:19.904 --> 00:12:22.156
as an elementary school principal.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.642
CC: I am fortunate to work
for a neighborhood school

00:12:24.666 --> 00:12:26.146
in Chicago Public Schools.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:29.470
AG: And should I be calling you
"Principal Callahan" from here on out?

00:12:29.494 --> 00:12:32.422
CC: No, that's so awkward, please don't.